WEBVTT

01:31.899 --> 01:37.224
[Flourished Peony]

01:37.224 --> 01:39.656
[Episode 24]

01:40.599 --> 01:42.120
Generally, the birthday banquet for the noble

01:42.680 --> 01:44.120
is undertaken by the flower guild.

01:45.560 --> 01:47.000
Do you know why this time

01:47.519 --> 01:50.359
such a bargain would fall
into the lap of someone like you?

01:52.439 --> 01:54.799
Madame Tang is extremely picky,

01:54.799 --> 01:57.040
and Tang Silang is unscrupulous.

01:57.719 --> 01:59.959
No shopkeeper in the flower guild
dares to accept the job.

02:00.599 --> 02:03.040
Huamanzhu has not joined the flower guild.

02:03.560 --> 02:05.319
Even if you mess this up,

02:05.840 --> 02:07.840
it won't implicate them.

02:07.840 --> 02:09.120
To them, you are

02:10.360 --> 02:12.319
merely an excellent scapegoat.

02:12.319 --> 02:14.719
You, you and Lv Wanrong plotted
against me together.

02:16.319 --> 02:17.680
I am merely a domestic servant now.

02:18.479 --> 02:20.319
I don't have such great ability

02:21.039 --> 02:23.400
to make Guild Head Lv join hands with me.

02:24.439 --> 02:28.439
He, just like you, was in the dark
from beginning to end.

02:31.400 --> 02:34.240
You deliberately let me hear
the news about the birthday banquet,

02:35.000 --> 02:36.439
leading me to the flower guild.

02:37.199 --> 02:39.840
You used everyone just to drive me to my death.

02:39.840 --> 02:41.439
Your thoughts are so wicked.

02:44.199 --> 02:45.960
No one forced you to take this business.

02:46.520 --> 02:50.080
You ended up in this situation
all because of your greed.

02:56.639 --> 02:57.919
Dusk.

02:58.520 --> 02:59.960
Curfew is imminent.

03:00.840 --> 03:02.759
Cherish your last hours.

03:06.479 --> 03:08.039
Lady He.

03:08.039 --> 03:10.400
Lady He, may you not bear grudges
for past offenses.

03:10.400 --> 03:11.599
Please help me get through this difficulty.

03:13.159 --> 03:15.000
Lady He.

03:16.639 --> 03:19.240
Lady He, the birthday banquet begins
in the afternoon.

03:19.240 --> 03:22.800
If you don't leave now, the flowers
in vases won't be salvageable.

03:24.120 --> 03:27.919
Lady He, please show mercy and spare my life.

03:27.919 --> 03:29.032
I beg you.

03:33.560 --> 03:35.039
Now you know to beg me.

03:36.800 --> 03:38.199
If you want me to take action, that's possible.

03:39.120 --> 03:40.919
But you must agree to my three conditions.

03:40.919 --> 03:42.000
Missing one, no discussion.

03:42.719 --> 03:43.879
Fine, state them.

03:45.360 --> 03:48.120
First, immediately return Huamanzhu.

03:48.800 --> 03:51.039
All earnings from the birthday banquet
go to me.

03:53.639 --> 03:56.648
Of course, I can wait for you to botch this up

03:56.648 --> 03:57.680
and lose your life…

03:57.680 --> 03:59.159
Fine, I agree.

04:02.400 --> 04:05.840
Second, apologize to Shengyi by kowtowing.

04:07.439 --> 04:08.488
Mudan.

04:12.520 --> 04:15.280
She has thin fortune. To kowtow to her,

04:16.840 --> 04:18.600
I don't know if she can bear it.

04:20.720 --> 04:22.839
When you used to beat her in the past,

04:23.879 --> 04:26.120
did you ever ask if she could bear it?

04:27.079 --> 04:30.399
This humiliation is what you deserve.

04:46.160 --> 04:47.519
Who are you trying to fool?

04:48.920 --> 04:50.680
Let me tell you, Wang Qing,

04:50.680 --> 04:52.560
the wounds on Shengyi's body,
the blood at the corner of her mouth,

04:52.560 --> 04:53.959
an eye for an eye.

04:54.720 --> 04:55.920
How this apology should be made,

04:56.519 --> 04:58.160
you better think this through clearly.

04:58.759 --> 05:02.160
You don't have much time left, kowtow.

05:03.839 --> 05:06.639
Mudan, you don't have to do this for me.

05:07.279 --> 05:09.199
I am telling you to kowtow.

05:20.904 --> 05:22.079
Darling, I was wrong.

05:22.639 --> 05:23.688
Please forgive me.

05:24.199 --> 05:25.439
Darling, I was wrong.

05:25.439 --> 05:26.879
Please forgive me.

05:26.879 --> 05:28.120
Darling, I was wrong.

05:28.120 --> 05:29.319
Please forgive me.

05:29.319 --> 05:30.439
Darling, I was wrong.

05:30.439 --> 05:31.592
Please forgive me.

05:35.120 --> 05:36.200
Enough.

05:39.360 --> 05:40.424
Don't cry.

05:48.920 --> 05:52.480
Since Shengyi has chosen to reconcile with you,

05:54.639 --> 05:58.199
from now on, I hope you will behave properly

05:58.199 --> 05:59.519
and treat her well.

06:00.399 --> 06:02.800
If you dare to belittle or insult her again,

06:03.720 --> 06:05.560
even if you hurt a single hair on her head,

06:06.639 --> 06:09.680
I will make you suffer ten times,
a hundred times worse than today.

06:09.680 --> 06:10.839
Do you understand?

06:13.360 --> 06:16.360
Yes, I dare not do it again.

06:21.120 --> 06:23.160
What is your third condition?

06:39.879 --> 06:41.759
How about these flowers?
Can they still be used?

06:44.079 --> 06:45.079
They should be able to be revived.

06:45.920 --> 06:47.959
We don't need to buy new flowers
from the florists anymore.

06:48.959 --> 06:50.600
Wang Qing has been gone for so long,

06:50.600 --> 06:52.000
and he has brought back
such a young lady as you.

06:52.712 --> 06:54.199
Where is he?

06:54.199 --> 06:56.720
Wang Qing is useless. He specifically asked
Mudan to save the flowers.

06:56.720 --> 06:58.480
She is the former owner of Huamanzhu.

06:58.480 --> 06:59.600
She can nurture any flower.

07:01.120 --> 07:02.519
So it's Lady He.

07:03.040 --> 07:06.040
Lady He is no longer the owner of Huamanzhu.

07:06.040 --> 07:07.040
There is no need to force it.

07:08.079 --> 07:10.120
Silang is friends with Mr. Jiang.

07:10.800 --> 07:12.399
If this birthday banquet, through your hands,

07:12.399 --> 07:13.879
encounters a mishap, I fear…

07:14.720 --> 07:16.439
Huamanzhu has already returned to my ownership.

07:17.000 --> 07:19.839
Whether Madame Tang's birthday banquet
can be adorned with flourishing flowers,

07:19.839 --> 07:21.040
I care just as much as you do.

07:21.560 --> 07:23.519
Time is pressing, I hope you trust me

07:23.519 --> 07:24.520
and follow my lead.

07:31.199 --> 07:33.120
These flowers have wilted due to lack of water.

07:33.120 --> 07:35.560
It is necessary to immerse with water
deeper than the flower stems

07:35.560 --> 07:37.279
so that all these flowers can
fully absorb the water.

07:37.959 --> 07:39.680
Fu, go and check,

07:39.680 --> 07:41.000
see if there's any water
that has been left standing overnight.

07:41.000 --> 07:43.399
If not, fetch more from the deep well.

07:44.560 --> 07:47.519
Madam, please boil more water.

07:47.519 --> 07:48.552
I'll do it right now.

07:52.639 --> 07:54.160
The water must be clean.

07:54.680 --> 07:56.160
Given my special circumstances currently,

07:56.160 --> 07:57.519
I can only trouble you

07:57.519 --> 08:00.079
to send someone to the Tang Mansion
before the curfew

08:00.079 --> 08:01.600
to fetch more top-quality charcoal.

08:02.160 --> 08:03.439
Alright, I'll send someone right away.

08:04.160 --> 08:05.224
Quickly!

08:05.224 --> 08:06.376
- Yes.
- Yes.

08:08.879 --> 08:10.160
The summer heat is stifling.

08:10.160 --> 08:13.160
When these flowers are transported
to the garden outside the city,

08:13.160 --> 08:15.439
please place ice blocks
around the banquet hall.

08:16.360 --> 08:17.448
Okay.

08:25.519 --> 08:26.632
What is this?

08:28.600 --> 08:29.839
This is my secret recipe,

08:29.839 --> 08:30.920
which can clear the flower stems.

08:31.839 --> 08:33.679
Rest assured, tomorrow,

08:33.679 --> 08:35.960
these flowers will surely
be as fresh as before.

08:55.120 --> 08:57.200
Fu, just burn this.

09:00.879 --> 09:02.279
Look, do you see it?

09:02.279 --> 09:03.304
Look at this change.

09:03.304 --> 09:09.096
♫ Flowing into a scorching long river ♫

09:11.440 --> 09:12.616
This branch is fine.

09:14.632 --> 09:20.279
♫ Youth sets its own wandering path ♫

09:20.279 --> 09:21.352
Okay.

09:22.840 --> 09:23.944
Madam.

09:23.944 --> 09:26.696
♫ Let not the secular world constrain ♫

09:26.696 --> 09:29.768
♫ How can they guess with mundane eyes ♫

09:29.768 --> 09:36.424
♫ Smiling as the storm stir the dust ♫

09:36.424 --> 09:39.912
♫ Flowers should bloom proudly ♫

09:39.912 --> 09:42.088
♫ Reflecting the color of the sky ♫

09:42.088 --> 09:44.040
♫ Never withering ♫

09:44.040 --> 09:50.184
♫ Do not fail the varied fragrance ♫

09:56.219 --> 09:59.080
♫ Let not the secular world constrain ♫

09:59.080 --> 10:02.120
♫ How can they guess with mundane eyes ♫

10:02.120 --> 10:08.680
♫ Smiling as the storm stir the dust ♫

10:08.680 --> 10:11.944
♫ Flowers should bloom proudly ♫

10:11.944 --> 10:14.472
♫ Reflecting the color of the sky ♫

10:14.472 --> 10:16.328
♫ Never withering ♫

10:16.328 --> 10:22.952
♫ Do not fail the varied fragrance ♫

10:27.919 --> 10:28.968
Mr. Tang.

10:30.279 --> 10:31.528
Mr. Tang.

10:33.639 --> 10:34.728
Lady He.

10:35.759 --> 10:36.872
Please look.

10:39.519 --> 10:40.584
Well,

10:42.759 --> 10:45.279
this is very good, very good indeed.

10:47.039 --> 10:49.440
The flower vessels chosen
by Wang Qing are not good.

10:49.440 --> 10:52.072
I'm not very skilled in flower arrangement.

10:52.072 --> 10:53.159
Well…

10:53.159 --> 10:54.519
But you need not worry.

10:54.519 --> 10:57.399
Before coming here, I had spoken with a florist
who excels at flower arrangement

10:57.399 --> 10:58.399
and made arrangements.

10:58.919 --> 11:02.440
I will take note of all the floral materials
here and inform him.

11:02.440 --> 11:05.320
He will choose the appropriate vessels
based on the floral materials.

11:05.320 --> 11:06.759
It absolutely won't miss the auspicious time.

11:07.440 --> 11:10.320
That would be good.

11:10.320 --> 11:11.400
Rest assured.

11:12.919 --> 11:14.759
Fu, as soon as the workshop door opens,

11:14.759 --> 11:16.840
I will go ask for the flower vessels.

11:16.840 --> 11:18.039
It's up to you concerning Wang Qing.

11:18.679 --> 11:20.679
Rest assured, I will definitely watch over him

11:20.679 --> 11:21.759
to vent this anger for you.

11:25.320 --> 11:28.480
Rogue merchant Wang Qing framed his wife,

11:29.039 --> 11:30.679
conspiring to seize others' property.

11:31.440 --> 11:33.799
He reaps the consequences
for being without sincerity and trust.

11:34.559 --> 11:37.399
Today, Huamanzhu returns to its original owner.

11:37.399 --> 11:38.960
Fairness to both young and old.

11:45.120 --> 11:49.080
Rogue merchant Wang Qing framed his wife,

11:49.080 --> 11:50.840
conspiring to seize others' property.

11:51.840 --> 11:54.919
He reaps the consequences
for being without sincerity and trust.

11:56.240 --> 11:58.519
Today, Huamanzhu returns to its original owner.

11:59.080 --> 12:00.679
Fairness to both young and old.

12:25.639 --> 12:27.960
Lady He, truly a master of your craft!

12:32.360 --> 12:33.576
You flatter me.

12:34.080 --> 12:35.176
Hurry up.

12:35.176 --> 12:36.360
Yes.

12:42.840 --> 12:43.944
He's been paraded through the streets all day.

12:43.944 --> 12:45.240
Truly rotten to the core, serves him right.

12:46.200 --> 12:49.879
Rogue merchant Wang Qing,
conspiring to seize others' property.

12:49.879 --> 12:50.888
Louder.

12:52.519 --> 12:55.720
Rogue merchant Wang Qing,
conspiring to seize others' property.

12:56.320 --> 12:59.360
He reaps the consequences
for being without sincerity and trust.

13:00.159 --> 13:02.960
Today, Huamanzhu returns to its original owner.

13:02.960 --> 13:04.320
Fairness to both young and old.

13:21.759 --> 13:22.920
Shengyi.

13:33.200 --> 13:34.280
You have returned.

13:45.559 --> 13:48.360
I just saw you waiting for me at the gate.

13:49.639 --> 13:51.399
I thought you were willing to come back.

13:53.840 --> 13:56.200
Only by seeing you return victorious
with my own eyes

13:56.799 --> 13:58.120
can I be at ease.

14:00.919 --> 14:04.320
Now, I have no more concerns.

14:06.039 --> 14:07.080
I take my leave.

14:09.879 --> 14:11.200
I just don't understand.

14:12.720 --> 14:15.320
You clearly know what
a despicable scoundrel Wang Qing is.

14:16.799 --> 14:18.759
Why do you still refuse to leave?

14:20.000 --> 14:21.480
What good would leaving do?

14:24.639 --> 14:26.399
What I seek is different from what you seek.

14:27.320 --> 14:29.000
Like most women,

14:30.279 --> 14:33.320
I desire a husband, I desire children.

14:35.600 --> 14:37.240
But I can no longer bear children.

14:44.519 --> 14:46.240
You never told me that.

14:48.679 --> 14:52.159
Some pain, only those
who experience it can understand.

14:56.639 --> 14:59.440
You are not the only woman
in this world unable to bear children.

15:00.600 --> 15:01.720
After you leave him,

15:02.720 --> 15:04.279
you may well meet a good man.

15:05.120 --> 15:06.240
Whoever I meet again,

15:06.240 --> 15:08.440
can it be guaranteed
they won't look down on me?

15:08.440 --> 15:10.200
Why care how others view you?

15:10.200 --> 15:11.840
It's about cherishing yourself.

15:16.200 --> 15:18.600
This is the biggest difference
between you and me.

15:19.879 --> 15:21.159
You cherish yourself.

15:22.639 --> 15:25.279
But I

15:26.320 --> 15:28.440
extremely loathe myself.

15:31.480 --> 15:34.600
Shengyi, you…

15:36.120 --> 15:39.039
Because I am lowly and cowardly,

15:39.039 --> 15:40.799
I have never had a choice.

15:41.399 --> 15:44.320
I despise being born into such a family.

15:44.919 --> 15:48.000
I despise myself for never resisting

15:48.000 --> 15:50.000
before being married off to such a brute.

15:50.840 --> 15:52.039
I despise myself.

15:52.799 --> 15:54.120
As soon as I return home,

15:55.039 --> 15:56.799
I'd turn back into Qin Wuniang.

15:57.720 --> 15:59.320
I despise myself even more

15:59.320 --> 16:01.080
for ruining everything

16:01.600 --> 16:04.240
after receiving your sincere love.

16:08.360 --> 16:09.879
But what I hate the most…

16:10.559 --> 16:11.919
What I hate the most is

16:12.960 --> 16:14.960
that I am a woman.

16:16.120 --> 16:20.120
Once a woman is despised by her husband,

16:21.120 --> 16:24.039
why is she then despised by the whole world?

16:33.799 --> 16:34.856
I am sorry.

16:36.360 --> 16:37.559
I should have realized earlier

16:39.840 --> 16:42.519
that you were tortured so painfully
by conventional norms.

16:44.399 --> 16:45.679
I regard you as a sister.

16:47.039 --> 16:48.360
But at this moment,

16:50.240 --> 16:52.600
it seems I have never understood you.

16:54.519 --> 16:56.399
You have not wronged me.

16:56.399 --> 16:58.200
It is I who have let you down too much.

16:59.360 --> 17:01.240
I have despised myself for too many years.

17:02.360 --> 17:03.600
I can't change it.

17:05.599 --> 17:07.240
There is no wrong in us being women.

17:07.920 --> 17:10.000
It is those who hurt you and belittle you
who are wrong.

17:10.880 --> 17:12.880
This world has evils like Wang Qing.

17:12.880 --> 17:15.319
Naturally, there will be good people
worth entrusting yourself to.

17:15.319 --> 17:16.440
Even if there are none,

17:16.440 --> 17:18.440
as women, we can rely on our own hands

17:18.440 --> 17:19.960
to diligently and steadfastly work.

17:21.039 --> 17:22.152
You still have me.

17:23.400 --> 17:24.519
You have Chun and Fu.

17:24.519 --> 17:25.839
We are with you together.

17:26.759 --> 17:28.200
Let's start over from the beginning.

17:44.640 --> 17:45.759
I have said so much.

17:46.759 --> 17:48.440
But you still decide to leave, right?

17:54.319 --> 17:55.496
Okay.

17:56.920 --> 17:57.960
In this case,

17:58.759 --> 18:01.680
as you are the second shopkeeper
of Huamanzhu, I must give you the money.

18:02.440 --> 18:03.759
Keep it close for your use.

18:03.759 --> 18:06.640
Mudan, you've already done enough for me.

18:06.640 --> 18:08.319
There's no need to say these things between us.

18:10.960 --> 18:12.440
For Huamanzhu's success today,

18:13.440 --> 18:14.920
I am aware of all your contributions.

18:17.279 --> 18:19.079
Keep this money well.

18:20.200 --> 18:22.079
Make sure Wang Qing doesn't find it out.

18:29.359 --> 18:30.799
There is another item.

18:30.799 --> 18:34.519
I intended to keep it to give to you
when there's a chance in the future.

18:35.720 --> 18:38.920
In this case, I will bring it too.

18:46.559 --> 18:47.624
Shengyi,

18:49.720 --> 18:50.888
wait for me.

19:02.119 --> 19:03.519
Shengyi.

19:05.920 --> 19:07.400
Shengyi.

19:08.519 --> 19:09.800
Shengyi.

19:11.960 --> 19:16.119
This name really sounds nice.

19:32.955 --> 19:36.392
[Huamanzhu]

19:38.960 --> 19:40.072
Thank you, everyone.

19:41.039 --> 19:42.319
Although our Huamanzhu

19:42.319 --> 19:45.440
made a name at the birthday banquet
in the Tang Mansion,

19:45.440 --> 19:47.680
noblemen are still rare.

19:48.319 --> 19:49.920
It's the common people
who are in the big world.

19:50.480 --> 19:51.720
In the future, our business

19:51.720 --> 19:54.920
will still rely on individual flowers
and boxes of incense powder.

19:54.920 --> 19:57.599
Don't entertain thoughts
of deceit and trickery.

19:57.599 --> 19:58.600
Understood.

19:59.240 --> 20:02.599
The jasmine, gardenia, and wild roses
we improved before

20:02.599 --> 20:05.119
have a long bloom period and robust flowers.

20:05.119 --> 20:07.119
They can be used as affordable potted plants.

20:07.640 --> 20:08.880
As for the expensive ones,

20:08.880 --> 20:11.559
cymbidiums, roses, and lotuses,

20:12.279 --> 20:15.240
be sure to explain clearly
to the customers before selling

20:15.240 --> 20:17.519
that they have a short bloom time
and are difficult to care for.

20:17.519 --> 20:19.240
But their value lies in their rarity.

20:19.240 --> 20:20.960
Only Huamanzhu can cultivate them.

20:21.599 --> 20:23.519
If the customers have any doubts,

20:23.519 --> 20:25.119
we must not, for the sake of selling flowers,

20:25.119 --> 20:27.200
lie or deceive people, understood?

20:27.200 --> 20:28.264
Understood.

20:29.160 --> 20:30.759
People who are willing
to spend money on these flowers

20:30.759 --> 20:32.079
want something different from others.

20:32.079 --> 20:34.480
Most of them don't care
about the length of the bloom period.

20:34.480 --> 20:35.560
You're right.

20:36.240 --> 20:38.480
Mudan, I've used our new summer flowers

20:38.480 --> 20:39.720
to mix a few new kinds of incense powder.

20:40.319 --> 20:42.119
Come and try the scent later.

20:42.119 --> 20:45.000
Okay, we can then come up
with more elegant names for them.

20:45.599 --> 20:48.079
Madam, I think the flowers used in the sachets

20:48.079 --> 20:49.279
can be changed accordingly.

20:49.279 --> 20:50.440
What do you think?

20:50.440 --> 20:51.528
I'll go with your suggestion.

20:55.240 --> 20:57.519
Tomorrow, I'll go to your place to see

20:57.519 --> 20:59.279
the newly cultivated Thousand-Petal Lotus.

20:59.279 --> 21:02.039
This flower attracts insects
more easily than other lotuses.

21:02.039 --> 21:03.440
If I am not around,

21:03.440 --> 21:05.480
I hope you two will be extra careful.

21:05.480 --> 21:08.200
We conduct regular patrols at night.

21:08.200 --> 21:10.519
We will never let such precious flowers
be harmed by insects.

21:11.079 --> 21:12.200
Thank you for your efforts.

21:26.640 --> 21:29.200
I suddenly met with a misfortune before.

21:30.160 --> 21:32.400
I have yet to settle the monthly payments
for everyone.

21:33.160 --> 21:34.559
But you bear no grudges

21:35.240 --> 21:37.319
and still wish to do business with me.

21:38.119 --> 21:39.144
I'm very grateful.

21:40.160 --> 21:43.079
I hope that in the future, everyone can
work together with me with one heart.

21:43.599 --> 21:45.240
Once I open a new store,

21:45.240 --> 21:48.799
I will increase everyone's monthly earnings
by twenty percent, is that okay?

21:48.799 --> 21:51.559
Good, thank you, Miss.

21:52.480 --> 21:54.000
You're kind and trustworthy.

21:54.000 --> 21:56.400
We have no worries
about food and clothing following you.

21:56.400 --> 21:57.960
Naturally, we will be fully dedicated.

21:57.960 --> 21:59.119
Please be assured.

22:01.519 --> 22:02.559
Thank you all for your hard work.

22:06.319 --> 22:08.200
Put some effort into it, grind it fine.

22:08.799 --> 22:09.960
Okay.

22:13.359 --> 22:14.400
Pat it.

22:16.279 --> 22:17.359
Gently sift it in a circular motion.

22:19.208 --> 22:21.992
♫ If the heart were like water ♫

22:21.992 --> 22:27.304
♫ The shadow of youth is ever-present ♫

22:27.304 --> 22:30.184
♫ Still cherish the moon of my hometown ♫

22:30.184 --> 22:35.440
♫ To meet for long ♫

22:35.440 --> 22:38.359
Mother, it won't be long,

22:39.279 --> 22:40.920
I will definitely take back
our Fragrance Garden.

22:42.200 --> 22:43.440
Just wait and see.

22:54.160 --> 22:55.839
Every time Mr. Liu takes the horse for a walk,

22:55.839 --> 22:58.160
Your Highness would come
to this desolate place to watch him.

22:58.160 --> 23:00.880
However, he does not say a word.

23:00.880 --> 23:03.880
Why should Your Highness of noble birth
suffer such grievances?

23:04.799 --> 23:06.400
Zishu is proud by heart.

23:06.400 --> 23:07.960
He was demoted to the Stables Bureau.

23:08.799 --> 23:11.000
It was my father
who forced him to face reality.

23:11.920 --> 23:14.160
He acts this way because he harbors
resentment in his heart.

23:14.160 --> 23:15.304
I don't blame him.

23:15.839 --> 23:18.480
It's just that Zishu will one day understand

23:18.480 --> 23:20.960
that this place is not where he belongs.

23:21.519 --> 23:22.920
As long as he turns back,

23:22.920 --> 23:26.119
I hope he can see right away
that I am waiting for him.

23:33.599 --> 23:34.640
Your Highness.

23:38.039 --> 23:40.440
Careful, have you hurt yourself?

23:48.039 --> 23:49.160
This is a pitfall trap.

23:50.119 --> 23:53.160
It was probably dug by hunters
in the mountains.

23:55.400 --> 23:56.839
Your Highness, I support you.

24:00.839 --> 24:02.160
Your Highness, be careful.

24:04.400 --> 24:05.720
Careful.

24:07.400 --> 24:08.680
Such a deep trap

24:09.559 --> 24:11.464
must be intended for capturing
very ferocious beasts.

24:11.464 --> 24:12.720
In these mountains…

24:12.720 --> 24:14.759
We sneaked out without bringing guards.

24:14.759 --> 24:16.480
We simply can't climb up by ourselves.

24:16.480 --> 24:17.880
If we encounter wild beasts…

24:17.880 --> 24:19.319
What shall we do, Your Highness?

24:19.319 --> 24:20.519
Why are you panicking?

24:21.559 --> 24:23.319
We are so close to the mountain village.

24:23.319 --> 24:25.240
If we shout loudly, someone
will surely come. Shout!

24:25.240 --> 24:26.376
Yes.

24:27.440 --> 24:29.880
Is anyone there? Help!

24:29.880 --> 24:33.039
County Princess Ji'an is here.
Come quickly to rescue!

24:33.720 --> 24:36.319
Help! Is there anyone out there?

24:37.359 --> 24:39.039
Louder! Keep shouting!

24:39.039 --> 24:42.160
Help! Save me!

24:42.160 --> 24:45.000
County Princess Ji'an is here.
Come quickly to rescue!

24:45.839 --> 24:49.160
Help! Is there anyone out there?

24:49.160 --> 24:52.960
County Princess Ji'an is in danger.
Come quickly to rescue!

24:53.880 --> 24:58.319
Help! Is there anyone out there?

24:58.839 --> 25:01.319
Help! Save us!

25:02.200 --> 25:04.240
Save us!

25:04.240 --> 25:08.160
County Princess Ji'an is in danger.
Come quickly to rescue!

25:08.759 --> 25:10.039
Help!

25:11.119 --> 25:12.880
Your Highness, what should we do?

25:12.880 --> 25:14.568
It's getting darker.

25:14.568 --> 25:15.799
If we still…

25:15.799 --> 25:17.079
What's the use of crying?

25:17.079 --> 25:18.359
If you don't want to die here, keep shouting.

25:18.359 --> 25:19.920
Shout loudly, quickly!

25:23.920 --> 25:28.119
Save us! Is anyone there?

25:28.119 --> 25:32.559
County Princess Ji'an is in danger.
Come quickly to rescue!

25:33.920 --> 25:35.559
Save us!

25:36.440 --> 25:37.799
Help!

25:38.880 --> 25:40.839
Her Highness is in danger.

25:46.759 --> 25:48.440
Save us!

26:11.960 --> 26:13.599
Biyu, someone's coming!

26:14.640 --> 26:15.752
Help me up.

26:15.752 --> 26:16.880
- Your Highness.
- Quickly!

26:16.880 --> 26:18.160
Be careful, slowly.

26:18.160 --> 26:19.208
Slow down, Your Highness.

26:21.960 --> 26:25.119
Her Highness is here.

26:31.559 --> 26:33.880
No, it's not a person.

26:38.200 --> 26:40.160
It's a wolf.

26:44.584 --> 26:45.680
Biyu.

26:45.680 --> 26:48.559
Your Highness.

26:50.480 --> 26:54.039
Your Highness, we won't die here, will we?

27:01.119 --> 27:04.680
Surrounded by beasts,
fear of unpredictable life and death.

27:05.680 --> 27:07.720
She ought to experience this thoroughly.

27:09.640 --> 27:11.160
Finally got to vent the spleen.

27:12.279 --> 27:13.880
The wild wolves dare not jump down easily.

27:13.880 --> 27:15.200
At most, they'll just scare them.

27:15.759 --> 27:18.599
This bit of suffering is nothing compared
to what you endured in the military camp.

27:19.599 --> 27:20.640
If you ask me,

27:20.640 --> 27:22.839
she should be put in a sack
and beaten up directly.

27:24.640 --> 27:26.720
Striking others with your fist
will hurt your own hand.

27:27.319 --> 27:30.400
Besides, Fu's fists are so precious.

27:30.400 --> 27:32.079
Why waste it on such a person?

27:33.279 --> 27:34.376
- Your Highness!
- Your Highness!

27:34.376 --> 27:35.432
Your Highness!

27:35.432 --> 27:36.559
- Your Highness!
- Your Highness!

27:36.559 --> 27:37.640
Your Highness!

27:37.640 --> 27:38.720
- Your Highness!
- Your Highness!

27:38.720 --> 27:40.079
Your Highness!

27:41.559 --> 27:42.880
The County Princess's status is noble.

27:43.960 --> 27:45.039
With just a message,

27:45.039 --> 27:47.039
everyone in the mansion
will come to her rescue.

27:47.839 --> 27:51.640
But the mute girl was nameless and unknown.

27:52.519 --> 27:54.039
She wrongfully died tragically in the army.

27:55.559 --> 27:56.616
Apart from me,

27:58.680 --> 28:00.240
who else would remember her?

28:03.119 --> 28:04.279
Your Highness!

28:05.119 --> 28:07.599
Your Highness!

28:08.359 --> 28:11.920
- Your Highness!
- Your Highness!

28:47.240 --> 28:48.456
Go fetch the paper kite.

28:48.456 --> 28:49.512
Yes.

29:03.599 --> 29:05.559
It was the birthday of the Eastern Capital's
caretaker a few days ago.

29:05.559 --> 29:08.240
Liu Shen didn't go but sent two large boxes
of congratulatory gifts.

29:08.240 --> 29:10.519
The gifts are so valuable,
far exceeding his annual salary.

29:12.400 --> 29:14.160
When entertaining in Luoyang,

29:14.160 --> 29:15.799
he was using the daughter-in-law's dowry
to supplement.

29:16.519 --> 29:18.279
How long has it been
since he came to in Chang'an?

29:18.279 --> 29:19.559
He has gotten so rich already.

29:20.559 --> 29:23.160
Truly a big rat eating my millet.

29:23.799 --> 29:24.799
Liu Chang was demoted,

29:25.319 --> 29:27.720
but his father's position as the Minister
of the Imperial Treasury is so securely held.

29:27.720 --> 29:28.839
It must be with the tacit consent
of Prince Ning.

29:31.480 --> 29:34.119
We must find out
where Liu Shen's money comes from.

29:35.640 --> 29:37.799
How to start bringing down Mr. Chen

29:37.799 --> 29:39.848
depends on whether the Liu family
is impenetrable.

29:39.848 --> 29:40.960
Yes.

29:40.960 --> 29:42.440
Lady He, you've come.

29:42.440 --> 29:43.519
Is Mr. Jiang here?

29:44.480 --> 29:46.960
Mr. Jiang has instructed, he is currently…

29:51.839 --> 29:53.079
Mr. Jiang, this is…

29:57.079 --> 29:58.880
A new slingshot prepared for the children.

29:58.880 --> 30:00.839
Just right to test if it can be pulled.

30:17.759 --> 30:20.000
You plant flowers on ordinary days,
so your hands are indeed strong.

30:20.720 --> 30:21.960
It's just the aim is too poor.

30:23.440 --> 30:25.000
Do you have poor eyesight?

30:26.359 --> 30:27.680
Among thousands of people,

30:27.680 --> 30:29.880
I spotted your extraordinariness
at first glance.

30:29.880 --> 30:31.119
Is my eyesight not good?

30:33.039 --> 30:34.559
It's just that I have never practiced this.

30:35.519 --> 30:38.440
If I practice, I might not miss.

30:43.880 --> 30:44.880
Rather than picking a date,
it's better to just make it happen.

30:46.640 --> 30:47.720
Let's practice today.

30:55.240 --> 30:56.328
Zhaocai.

31:06.839 --> 31:07.880
My lord, spare my life.

31:15.400 --> 31:20.480
You are not usually one
to torment your servants.

31:20.480 --> 31:21.640
What's the matter today?

31:22.319 --> 31:24.160
My aim is poor.

31:24.160 --> 31:25.359
How is it torment?

31:26.920 --> 31:28.680
You know it in your heart

31:28.680 --> 31:30.200
you won't hurt him.

31:30.720 --> 31:32.000
But he doesn't know that.

31:32.000 --> 31:33.799
He must be feeling frightened.

31:34.799 --> 31:37.440
If you can't bear to watch, let it be.

31:43.400 --> 31:46.720
Mr. Jiang, I've just recently
gotten back Huamanzhu.

31:46.720 --> 31:48.552
The interest for this month isn't that much.

31:48.552 --> 31:49.680
Please be patient with me.

31:49.680 --> 31:51.400
Rest assured, next month,

31:51.400 --> 31:52.720
I definitely won't disappoint you.

31:53.359 --> 31:56.519
Also, the money for the previous purchasing
from my hometown is all in there.

31:58.559 --> 32:01.000
Besides…

32:01.799 --> 32:03.079
I want to retrieve my own indenture.

32:03.079 --> 32:04.880
I want to drink wine and chat with Mudan.

32:05.440 --> 32:07.720
You go fly this paper kite.

32:07.720 --> 32:09.319
Fly it higher.

32:09.319 --> 32:12.079
If you can win a smile from Mudan,
there will be a reward.

32:12.799 --> 32:13.864
Yes.

32:22.599 --> 32:25.720
What are you flying there? Go down and fly it.

32:25.720 --> 32:26.856
Yes.

32:42.319 --> 32:44.519
Do you have a grudge against this lad?

32:46.799 --> 32:47.839
You guess.

32:53.640 --> 32:54.664
Chuanyu.

33:00.799 --> 33:04.039
Mr. Jiang, the money with which you bought me,

33:04.039 --> 33:05.279
I've also put it in there.

33:05.960 --> 33:07.112
It's placed here.

33:09.680 --> 33:12.279
Mr. Jiang, when you're free,

33:12.279 --> 33:13.640
could you go to the authorities

33:14.880 --> 33:17.559
to change my household registration?

33:18.640 --> 33:21.319
I understand, the favor of getting
a decent register is another matter.

33:21.319 --> 33:23.880
You name a price, I will definitely
make up the amount next time.

33:25.480 --> 33:27.039
You previously said we were good friends.

33:27.039 --> 33:28.400
Today you're acting so distant.

33:29.000 --> 33:30.799
It's not the first time dealing with documents
for a decent household register.

33:30.799 --> 33:31.960
I'm not short of this bit of money.

33:32.759 --> 33:35.880
Yes, it's just that even brothers
must settle accounts clearly.

33:35.880 --> 33:39.200
With give and take, only then
can a friendship last long.

33:39.880 --> 33:42.240
Moreover, a big favor
like getting a decent register,

33:42.960 --> 33:45.759
I really do not know how to repay you.

33:45.759 --> 33:47.440
I can only give you money.

33:48.160 --> 33:49.400
You left the military camp.

33:50.079 --> 33:51.839
The County Princess and the Liu family
will surely know it.

33:52.880 --> 33:56.240
Do you want the decent household register
or do you want your life?

33:58.680 --> 34:01.079
With me here, they wouldn't dare
lay a finger on you.

34:01.799 --> 34:04.119
You should keep a low profile
and focus on making money for now.

34:04.759 --> 34:08.240
When the time comes,
I will return the indenture to you.

34:11.039 --> 34:13.679
Thank you very much for your protection.

34:18.696 --> 34:19.848
Please take care.

34:21.280 --> 34:22.320
How do I make a reservation for the cymbidium?

34:22.888 --> 34:23.960
This wild rose is really beautiful.

34:23.960 --> 34:24.960
I would like three pots of jasmine.

34:24.960 --> 34:25.960
Please follow me.

34:25.960 --> 34:27.880
- Please keep it well.
- Okay.

34:27.880 --> 34:29.096
I like this one as well.

34:32.840 --> 34:34.599
Fu is in good health.

34:34.599 --> 34:37.079
This rash on the hands
isn't caused by internal heat.

34:37.079 --> 34:40.079
It's because the hands are in contact
with these moldy ears of corn all day.

34:40.079 --> 34:41.559
That's why they become red, swollen, and itchy.

34:42.159 --> 34:43.599
These corn kernels are small.

34:43.599 --> 34:45.760
As long as the amount
of moldy corn mixed in is controlled,

34:45.760 --> 34:47.280
it's basically indistinguishable,

34:47.280 --> 34:48.639
not to mention

34:48.639 --> 34:51.400
washing the corn would remove
any trace of mold.

34:52.360 --> 34:53.880
Fortunately, you have discovered it.

34:53.880 --> 34:56.159
Otherwise, we would still be kept in the dark.

35:00.320 --> 35:03.280
What about these powders
and the incense powder from the outer room?

35:04.000 --> 35:06.360
Fortunately, the daily usage
of this incense powder isn't much.

35:06.880 --> 35:09.639
We must quickly recall the incense powder
we have sold before.

35:10.239 --> 35:12.000
Mudan, it's right to recall them.

35:12.679 --> 35:14.159
But with such an occurrence,

35:14.159 --> 35:16.840
people might not dare
to come to Huamanzhu again.

35:17.960 --> 35:19.679
We'll return the money

35:19.679 --> 35:21.039
and explain properly to everyone.

35:21.920 --> 35:23.400
If we can't obtain forgiveness,

35:23.400 --> 35:25.199
there's nothing we can do.

35:25.199 --> 35:26.760
We did what we could.

35:26.760 --> 35:28.119
As long as our conscience is clear.

35:29.199 --> 35:31.360
I'll go and collect all the incense powder
from the outer room.

35:31.360 --> 35:32.400
Thank you, Madam.

35:34.920 --> 35:36.880
Which conscienceless person has come
to harm us this time?

35:39.159 --> 35:42.599
I feel this matter isn't so simple.

35:43.920 --> 35:45.840
Chun, you said before

35:45.840 --> 35:48.800
recently there have been many more patients
with diarrhea and abdominal pain.

35:49.320 --> 35:53.199
Yes, but I have asked them one by one
about what they had eaten.

35:53.199 --> 35:55.280
It seems there was nothing abnormal.

35:55.840 --> 35:57.599
Thinking about it, ordinary people

35:57.599 --> 35:58.840
mostly eat corn as their staple.

35:59.360 --> 36:01.679
They naturally feel there is nothing wrong
with food they are accustomed to eating

36:01.679 --> 36:02.960
and wouldn't specifically report it.

36:03.679 --> 36:06.760
Could this be why I've never been able
to find the cause of the illness?

36:08.320 --> 36:09.760
I'll go with you to confirm it.

36:09.760 --> 36:12.000
See if those people ate corn
from the same source.

36:12.920 --> 36:14.039
Fu, stop scratching.

36:14.880 --> 36:15.976
It's itchy.

36:21.840 --> 36:23.320
Sesame seed cakes.

36:23.320 --> 36:25.800
Make way, please.

36:28.104 --> 36:29.159
Make way, please.

36:29.159 --> 36:30.480
Sheep liver cakes.

36:33.000 --> 36:34.719
The rice and wheat vendors at the West Market

36:34.719 --> 36:36.280
have actually adulterated
the grain with moldy corn.

36:38.280 --> 36:39.840
Eating such moldy corn every day

36:39.840 --> 36:41.360
will cause serious health issues.

36:42.079 --> 36:43.639
Who on earth is committing this atrocity?

36:46.152 --> 36:47.176
How is it?

36:48.239 --> 36:49.360
The rice from the East Market is fine.

36:55.079 --> 36:56.679
The rice from the East Market is fine.

36:57.920 --> 36:59.400
The East Market is frequented by the nobility

36:59.960 --> 37:02.119
while the West Market is
our common people's marketplace.

37:03.599 --> 37:06.480
I didn't expect them
to be profiteering like this.

37:08.400 --> 37:09.512
Who are they?

37:13.159 --> 37:14.184
We must act quickly.

37:15.079 --> 37:16.168
Okay, Master Liu.

37:16.840 --> 37:17.960
Master Liu, take care.

37:26.360 --> 37:29.119
I previously hired someone at the black market
to follow Liu Shen continuously.

37:29.119 --> 37:32.400
Liu Shen is very close to the market official
who oversees both the East and West Markets.

37:33.280 --> 37:34.760
This market official has held his position
for many years

37:34.760 --> 37:36.360
and has never made a mistake.

37:36.360 --> 37:38.079
Therefore, I did not pay attention
to it previously

37:41.000 --> 37:42.599
until I discovered the moldy corn.

37:42.599 --> 37:44.400
I sent someone to investigate carefully.

37:44.400 --> 37:48.480
Indeed, since Liu Shen became
the superior of this person,

37:48.480 --> 37:49.840
not just rice and wheat,

37:49.840 --> 37:53.320
the West Market has seen an increasing number
of inferior goods.

37:55.159 --> 37:58.000
The agricultural tools newly purchased
by the flower guild broke in less than half a month.

37:58.559 --> 38:00.280
My father originally thought
it was the buyer's fault

38:00.280 --> 38:01.920
that out of greed for a small profit,
they bought substandard goods.

38:02.960 --> 38:04.159
Thanks to your warning.

38:09.639 --> 38:12.159
Now that you are aware of the truth,

38:12.159 --> 38:13.224
what are your plans?

38:14.159 --> 38:15.159
Are you planning to report to the officials?

38:16.119 --> 38:17.840
The evildoer is a high-ranking official.

38:18.599 --> 38:20.360
My father is also powerless.

38:20.360 --> 38:22.239
He says that merchants
should not fight with officials.

38:24.519 --> 38:27.519
The guild head prudently protects himself.
It is truly a move made out of helplessness.

38:27.519 --> 38:28.559
It is understandable.

38:29.840 --> 38:30.920
But I…

38:31.480 --> 38:33.800
It's too dangerous,
you mustn't do anything foolish.

38:40.719 --> 38:42.159
It was just like this back then.

38:43.360 --> 38:45.679
The Liu family passed off fake tribute medicine
as high quality,

38:45.679 --> 38:47.440
delaying my chance to treat my mother.

38:48.159 --> 38:50.519
Now, they have not restrained themselves.

38:50.519 --> 38:51.840
Instead, they intensified their efforts.

38:52.559 --> 38:55.000
They completely disregard the livelihood
and wellbeing of the common people.

38:56.599 --> 38:59.039
As long as such a corrupt official
holds office for one day,

38:59.039 --> 39:01.800
all of us have to live in fear for that day.

39:03.880 --> 39:07.119
Liu Shen, I will not let him off.

39:09.880 --> 39:11.039
I am a healer.

39:11.039 --> 39:13.760
Watching people swallow moldy corn,
becoming weak and frail,

39:13.760 --> 39:14.856
it is truly unbearable.

39:15.880 --> 39:19.440
Mudan, I am willing to do
this foolish thing with you.

39:21.599 --> 39:24.320
Rest assured, I will not be like an egg
striking a stone.

39:24.320 --> 39:25.559
When I need you,

39:25.559 --> 39:26.599
I will naturally tell you.

39:36.280 --> 39:39.280
My lord, Prince Ning
is gathering wealth excessively.

39:39.280 --> 39:41.559
It seems only Shuo Fang and Fan Yang,
the two Military Governors

39:41.559 --> 39:43.119
sharing his mindset is not enough.

39:43.119 --> 39:44.679
He wants to win over more Military Governors.

39:45.960 --> 39:47.719
The grand ambition of Prince Ning

39:47.719 --> 39:49.199
requires smoothing things over everywhere.

39:49.760 --> 39:51.079
Naturally, he spends money like water.

39:52.920 --> 39:54.960
My lord, through the hands of Liu Shen,

39:54.960 --> 39:56.320
we could topple Prince Ning's money bag.

39:56.320 --> 39:57.440
Will it alarm Prince Ning?

39:58.599 --> 40:00.199
If conducting a thorough investigation
from top to bottom,

40:00.199 --> 40:01.320
Prince Ning would surely become suspicious.

40:02.360 --> 40:04.599
But if we investigate Liu Shen's crime
through the case of moldy corn,

40:05.360 --> 40:08.239
we could work our way up and implicates
his relationship with Mr. Chen.

40:09.199 --> 40:10.639
The marriage arrangement between Liu Chang
and the County Princess is no more.

40:11.159 --> 40:13.800
Starting from the Liu family, it would
be easiest for Prince Ning to clear himself.

40:15.079 --> 40:16.400
We are in the shadows.

40:16.400 --> 40:18.679
We just need to speak a few good words
for Prince Ning when the time comes.

40:19.320 --> 40:22.920
Then he would not suspect
that this purge was directed at him.

40:23.960 --> 40:26.199
My lord, the way you speak differently

40:26.199 --> 40:27.760
to different people

40:27.760 --> 40:30.000
has become increasingly refined. I admire it.

40:32.760 --> 40:34.199
All you know is to eat yourself.

40:34.199 --> 40:35.360
You don't even think to feed me one.

40:36.440 --> 40:37.672
My lord, please.

40:42.880 --> 40:44.040
My lord.

40:45.360 --> 40:47.360
How did you come at this hour?

40:48.840 --> 40:50.760
The prey we are watching
has been targeted by others.

40:53.599 --> 40:54.800
Who has no foresight?

40:54.800 --> 40:57.360
Jiang Xiao… Lady He.

41:03.800 --> 41:05.039
It seems she, just like us,

41:06.119 --> 41:07.519
has also set her sights on this big fish.

41:09.559 --> 41:13.039
These waters cannot stay calm for long.

41:33.119 --> 41:35.960
These days, the shop is busy,
which is very exhausting.

41:35.960 --> 41:37.639
I did not prepare late-night snacks.

41:37.639 --> 41:39.239
I hope you can forgive me, Mr. Jiang.

41:44.800 --> 41:47.840
How did you know it was me and not Zhu Fu?

42:07.579 --> 42:13.853
♫ In endless Chang'an,
the zither's melody distant ♫

42:15.707 --> 42:22.391
♫ Plum and willow trees bask in the sunshine,
as splendor returns with the year ♫

42:23.067 --> 42:30.265
♫ Copper palace battlements,
songs and dances, glass goblets ♫

42:31.259 --> 42:39.611
♫ Idle clouds and duckweed,
a thousand flowers burst forth ♫

42:39.611 --> 42:47.154
♫ Time passes gracefully,
affairs settle like fading smoke ♫

42:47.808 --> 42:55.995
♫ Let the years go by,
carried by the wind to early desires ♫

42:55.995 --> 43:03.806
♫ If the heart is like water,
the bloom is ever-present ♫

43:04.411 --> 43:11.703
♫ Still cherish the moon of my hometown,
to meet for long ♫

43:32.379 --> 43:39.262
♫ The distant night sky strewn with stars,
reflecting the lovely moon ♫

43:40.563 --> 43:47.257
♫ The peony's magnificent beauty
fills the Fragrance Garden ♫

43:48.014 --> 43:55.316
♫ With a heart as my lantern,
I don't mind the distant mountain paths ♫

43:56.000 --> 44:04.309
♫ The flute's sound,
a fleeting life's wishes fulfilled ♫

